#lang beagle/clj

;; ============================================================================
;; resolve-walk — THE LEXICAL WALK: every reference resolves to its NEAREST
;; enclosing binding, by identity.
;; ============================================================================
;; Stage M1 Cut G of the engine core port (north thread
;; 019f9f0e-de2a-7759-bb10-db8b14be6fad). This is the turtle-#5 heart of the
;; resolver: descend the ordered AST, carry a scope stack of frames, and for each
;; symbol leaf write the `refers_to` edge that names WHICH binding it means —
;; nearest-frame first, then the durable `bound_to` identity edge, then the
;; cross-module import surface, then module-local types / auto-constructors /
;; synthesized field accessors, else "native" (correctly no edge).
;;
;; Two structural adaptations, both forced and both behavior-preserving:
;;
;;   1. STATE IS A PARAMETER. resolve.clj's ^:dynamic vars cannot change
;;      namespace (server.clj and server tests `binding` them by
;;      qualified name), so — exactly as Cuts B–F — the store, view, tx,
;;      predicate value-ids, counters and the three resolver closures arrive
;;      HERE as one explicit `Walk` record, built by a one-line wrapper in
;;      resolve.clj that reads the dynamic state at call time.
;;
;;   2. NO FORWARD REFERENCES. walk / walk-all / walk-fn-arity / walk-pat-heads
;;      / walk-quasi / walk-quasi-seq are mutually recursive, and Beagle's clj
;;      emitter has no `declare` — the emitted namespace must be definable
;;      top-to-bottom. So the callee that would need a forward reference takes
;;      the function as a VALUE parameter (`wf` = the node walker, `qsf` = the
;;      quasiquote sibling scanner) and `walk!`, defined last, passes itself.
;;      A self-reference inside a defn body is fine (the var exists by the time
;;      the body runs); only the forward one is not.
;;
;; Everything that mutates the store carries a `!` suffix here that the raw
;; originals did not — Beagle's purity gate makes the write visible. resolve.clj
;; keeps the old bare spellings in its wrappers, so no caller moves.
;;
;; Binding declarations are structural per outer entry: a bare binding or one
;; complete `(binding-form Type)` / `(binding-form Type constraint)` form. The
;; walk never reconstructs a declaration from adjacent tokens.
;;
;; PER-DEF NOTES (adoption strips interior comments; the rationale lives here):
;;   bind!        one refers_to edge + the resolved counter. THE write.
;;   bind-xmod!   cross-module hit: refers_to plus the derived RENDER markers —
;;                :fixed (a :rename'd local keeps its own spelling),
;;                while an alias-qualified `a/foo` already carries its authored
;;                qualifier structurally,
;;                :tracking (render the target def's CURRENT name), and the
;;                synth-accessor field when the import is a `point-x`.
;;   bound-render!  #(a) identity re-render. A reference carrying the DURABLE
;;                bound_to edge resolves by identity (@mod#int), but its
;;                derived spelling markers were CLEARED by the strip+re-resolve
;;                that materialize/cold-boot performs — so re-derive them from
;;                the reference's own spelling. Identity always wins over
;;                spelling for the TARGET; spelling only picks the markers.
;;   walk-type!   a TYPE position: module-local type frame first, then the
;;                cross-module import surface; a compound `(Vec Any)` or a
;;                bracket vector recurses elementwise.
;;   walk-binding-types!  resolve only the type child of structural
;;                `(binding-form Type)` / `(binding-form Type constraint)` nodes
;;                selected by their grammar role; constraints are ordinary
;;                reference expressions.
;;   walk-all!    walk each node in the SAME scope and source order so reference
;;                materialization and diagnostics remain deterministic.
;;   walk-pat-heads!  a `match` pattern's constructor heads are TYPE references,
;;                nested sub-patterns included.
;;   walk-fn-arity!  one arity: params bind in the body; structural param types
;;                and the positional return resolve to type defs; binding-local
;;                constraints and `:or` defaults evaluate in the OUTER scope
;;                (before the params bind — a real capture bug if walked inside);
;;                a direct defn's optional `:raises Type` is read from its owned
;;                slot before the body. Macros have no return slot.
;;   walk-signature-types! / walk-method-types!  declaration signatures own and
;;                walk their type and constraint children in the declaration's
;;                surrounding scope.
;;   walk!        the dispatcher. Symbol → the resolution ladder; list → the
;;                binding-form vocabulary (type defs, def, fn/defn arities, let,
;;                for/doseq, match, letfn, extend-type, as->), else an ordinary
;;                call whose head and args are all references.
;;   walk-quasi!  inside a quasiquote template most symbols are DATA, but a bare
;;                template symbol naming a module def or import IS live (Clojure
;;                ns-qualifies it, beagle hygiene-aliases it), so a rename must
;;                follow it. `quoted?` tracks an inner (quote ..) — there a bare
;;                symbol is inert — but an unquote escapes to live code at ANY
;;                quote depth.
;;   walk-quasi-seq!  scans template siblings for beagle's bare `~`/`,` token
;;                form of unquote (the reader emits NO (unquote ..) wrapper), and
;;                escapes the FOLLOWING sibling back to live code.
;;   cbind! / resolve-comment! / walk-comments!  turtle #6: a comment segment
;;                that EXACTLY names an in-scope binding gets refers_to too, so
;;                a rename carries the prose with it (and only the exact token —
;;                `red-zone` is one symbol, not `red`).
;;   run-resolution-over! / run-resolution!  the driver: per src, install that
;;                module's three resolvers, walk its forms in a scope of exactly
;;                its module frame, then its comments. The cross-module tables
;;                are always WHOLE-corpus; only the walked SUBSET narrows (the
;;                S3.3 scoped re-resolve: full tables, partial walk).
;;   corpus-tables  the per-run frame/export tables resolve-edn! computes from
;;                the freshly loaded srcs — the portable half of resolve-edn!
;;                (its `binding`/`set!` scaffolding must stay in resolve.clj,
;;                because the dynamic vars themselves cannot move namespace).
;;
;; Consumed by resolve.clj — the emitted out/resolve_walk.clj must stay on the
;; classpath.
;; ============================================================================
(ns resolve-walk
  (:require [clojure.string :as str]
    [resolve-ident :as ri]
    [resolve-core :as rc]
    [resolve-read :as rr]
    [resolve-binds :as rb]
    [resolve-modules :as rm]))


(defrecord Walk
  [(ctx ri/Graph)
   (view Any)
   (REFERS Any)
   (BOUND Any)
   (FIXED Any)
   (QUAL Any)
   (CTOR Any)
   (ACC Any)
   (nres (Atom Int))
   (nunres (Atom Int))
   (nxmod (Atom Int))
   (ntype (Atom Int))
   (ncomment (Atom Int))
   (xres Any)
   (tres Any)
   (ares Any)])

(defrecord Corpus
  [(srcs (Vec Any)) (modframe Any) (typeframe Any) (accessors Any) (ents Any)])

;; The Int-typing sentinel is gone with the widening: a node id is a Term, and
;; an absent one now fails in t/triple instead of silently writing node -1.
(defn- nn [(e Any)] Any e)

(def UNQUOTE-TOKENS (Set String) #{"~" "," "~@" ",@"})

(defn- sv [(w Walk) (e Any)] Any (rr/sym-val (:ctx w) (:view w) e))

(defn- sq [(w Walk) (e Any)] Any (rr/sym-qualifier (:ctx w) (:view w) e))

(defn- kd [(w Walk) (e Any)] Any (rr/kind-of (:ctx w) (:view w) e))

(defn- hd [(w Walk) (e Any)] Any (rr/head-sym (:ctx w) (:view w) e))

(defn- kids [(w Walk) (e Any)] (Vec Any) (rr/ordered-children (:ctx w) e))

(defn- brk? [(w Walk) (e Any)] Bool (rb/brackets? (:ctx w) (:view w) e))

(defn- list? [(w Walk) (e Any)] Bool (= "list" (kd w e)))

(defn- xr [(w Walk) (node Any) (nm Any)] Any
  (let [f (:xres w)] (f (sq w node) nm)))

(defn- tr [(w Walk) (nm Any)] Any (let [f (:tres w)] (f nm)))

(defn- ar [(w Walk) (nm Any)] Any (let [f (:ares w)] (f nm)))

(defn- scope-lookup [(scope (Vec Any)) (nm Any)] Any
  (loop [i 0]
    (if (>= i (count scope))
      nil
      (let [hit (get (nth scope i) nm)] (if (nil? hit) (recur (inc i)) hit)))))

(defn- push [(frame Any) (scope (Vec Any))] (Vec Any) (into [frame] scope))

(defn bind! [(w Walk) (L Any) (target Any)] Any
  (do
    (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn L) (:REFERS w) (nn target))
    (swap! (:nres w) (fn [(n Int)] Int (inc n)))))

(defn bind-xmod! [(w Walk) (node Any) (x Any)] Any
  (if (or (nil? x) (nil? (get x :target)))
    nil
    (let [mode (get x :mode) acc (get x :accessor)]
      (do
        (bind! w node (get x :target))
        (when (= :fixed mode)
          (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn node) (:FIXED w) (ri/literal! "1")))
        (when (some? acc)
          (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn node) (:ACC w) (ri/literal! acc)))
        (swap! (:nxmod w) (fn [(n Int)] Int (inc n)))
        true))))

(defn bound-render! [(w Walk) (node Any) (nm Any) (bt Any)] Any
  (do
    (bind! w node bt)
    (let [x (xr w node nm) pfx (rc/ctor-prefix (if (string? nm) nm nil)) acc (ar w nm) stripped (if (nil? pfx) nil (str/replace (str nm) pfx ""))]
      (cond
        (and (some? x) (some? (get x :target)))
        (let [mode (get x :mode) xacc (get x :accessor)]
          (do
            (when (= :fixed mode)
              (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn node) (:FIXED w) (ri/literal! "1")))
            (when (some? xacc)
              (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn node) (:ACC w) (ri/literal! xacc)))))
        (and (some? pfx)
          (or (some? (tr w stripped)) (some? (get (xr w node stripped) :target))))
        (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn node) (:CTOR w) (ri/literal! pfx))
        (some? acc)
        (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn node) (:ACC w) (ri/literal! (nth acc 1)))
        :else
        nil))))

(defn walk-type! [(w Walk) (node Any)] Any
  (cond
    (some? (sv w node))
    (let [nm (sv w node) qualifier (sq w node) b (if (nil? qualifier) (tr w nm) nil)]
      (if (some? b)
        (do
          (bind! w node b)
          (swap! (:ntype w) (fn [(n Int)] Int (inc n)))
          true)
        (bind-xmod! w node (xr w node nm))))
    (= "list" (kd w node))
    (doseq [ch (kids w node)] (walk-type! w ch))
    (brk? w node)
    (doseq [ch (vec (rest (kids w node)))] (walk-type! w ch))
    :else
    nil))

(defn- walk-binding-types! [(w Walk) (types (Vec Any))] Any
  (doseq [type-node types] (walk-type! w type-node)))

(defn walk-all! [(w Walk) (nodes (Vec Any)) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any)] Any
  (doseq [n nodes] (wf w n scope)))

(defn walk-pat-heads! [(w Walk) (pat Any) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any)] Any
  (when (= "list" (kd w pat))
    (let [cs (kids w pat)]
      (do
        (wf w (nth cs 0 nil) scope)
        (doseq [ch (vec (rest cs))] (walk-pat-heads! w ch scope wf))))))

(defn- walk-fn-signature!
  [(w Walk) (signature Any) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any) (macro? Bool)] Any
  (when (some? signature)
    (let [params (get signature :params) binds (rb/param-binds (:ctx w) (:view w) params) constraints (rb/param-constraint-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) params) or-vals (reduce (fn
                                                                                                                                                                              [(acc
                                                                                                                                                                                (Vec
                                                                                                                                                                                 Any))
                                                                                                                                                                               (binding
                                                                                                                                                                                Any)]
                                                                                                                                                                              (Vec Any)
                                                                                                                                                                              (into acc (rb/collect-or-vals (:ctx w) (:view w) binding))) [] (vec (rest (kids w params)))) frame (rb/frame-of (:ctx w) (:view w) binds) return-type (get signature :return-type) raises-type (get signature :raises-type)]
      (do
        (when (not macro?)
          (walk-binding-types! w (rb/param-type-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) params)))
        (when (some? return-type) (walk-type! w return-type))
        (when (some? raises-type) (walk-type! w raises-type))
        (walk-all! w constraints scope wf)
        (walk-all! w or-vals scope wf)
        (walk-all! w (get signature :body) (push frame scope) wf)))))

(defn walk-fn-arity!
  [(w Walk) (forms (Vec Any)) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any) (macro? Bool)] Any
  (walk-fn-signature! w
    (rb/signature-parts
      (:ctx w) (:view w) forms macro? false)
    scope
    wf
    macro?))

(defn walk-quasi!
  [(w Walk) (node Any) (scope (Vec Any)) (quoted? Bool) (wf Any) (qsf Any)] Any
  (cond
    (some? (sv w node))
    (when (not quoted?)
      (let [nm (sv w node) qualifier (sq w node) outer (if (empty? scope) [] (vec (butlast scope))) modframe (if (empty? scope) nil (last scope)) inner (if (nil? qualifier) (scope-lookup outer nm) nil) mod-hit (if (nil? qualifier) (get modframe nm) nil)]
        (cond
          (some? inner)
          nil
          (some? mod-hit)
          (bind! w node mod-hit)
          (some? (bind-xmod! w node (xr w node nm)))
          nil
          :else
          nil)))
    (= "list" (kd w node))
    (let [h (hd w node)]
      (cond
        (contains? #{"unquote" "unquote-splicing"} (str h))
        (walk-all! w (vec (rest (kids w node))) scope wf)
        (= "quote" (str h))
        (qsf w (kids w node) scope true wf)
        :else
        (qsf w (kids w node) scope quoted? wf)))
    :else
    nil))

(defn walk-quasi-seq!
  [(w Walk) (children (Vec Any)) (scope (Vec Any)) (quoted? Bool) (wf Any)] Any
  (loop [(cs (Vec Any)) children]
    (if (empty? cs)
      nil
      (let [v (sv w (nth cs 0 nil))]
        (if (and (some? v) (contains? UNQUOTE-TOKENS (str v)))
          (do
            (when (some? (nth cs 1 nil)) (wf w (nth cs 1 nil) scope))
            (recur (vec (drop 2 cs))))
          (do
            (walk-quasi! w (nth cs 0 nil) scope quoted? wf walk-quasi-seq!)
            (recur (vec (rest cs)))))))))

(defn- try-type! [(w Walk) (node Any) (nm Any)] Bool
  (let [b (tr w nm)]
    (if (nil? b)
      false
      (do
        (bind! w node b)
        (swap! (:ntype w) (fn [(n Int)] Int (inc n)))
        true))))

(defn- try-ctor! [(w Walk) (node Any) (nm Any)] Bool
  (let [pfx (rc/ctor-prefix (if (string? nm) nm nil)) qualifier (sq w node)]
    (if (nil? pfx)
      false
      (let [stripped (str/replace (str nm) pfx "") b (if (nil? qualifier) (tr w stripped) nil)]
        (if (some? b)
          (do
            (bind! w node b)
            (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn node) (:CTOR w) (ri/literal! pfx))
            (swap! (:ntype w) (fn [(n Int)] Int (inc n)))
            true)
          (if (some? (bind-xmod! w node (xr w node stripped)))
            (do
              (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn node) (:CTOR w) (ri/literal! pfx))
              true)
            false))))))

(defn- try-accessor! [(w Walk) (node Any) (nm Any)] Bool
  (let [a (ar w nm)]
    (if (nil? a)
      false
      (do
        (bind! w node (nth a 0))
        (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn node) (:ACC w) (ri/literal! (nth a 1)))
        (swap! (:ntype w) (fn [(n Int)] Int (inc n)))
        true))))

(defn- walk-signature-types!
  [(w Walk) (signature Any) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any)] Any
  (when (some? signature)
    (do
      (walk-binding-types! w
        (rb/param-type-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) (get signature :params)))
      (when (some? (get signature :return-type))
        (walk-type! w (get signature :return-type)))
      (when (some? (get signature :raises-type))
        (walk-type! w (get signature :raises-type)))
      (walk-all! w
        (rb/param-constraint-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) (get signature :params))
        scope
        wf))))

(defn- walk-method-types!
  [(w Walk) (raw-method Any) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any)] Any
  (let [method (rr/unwrap-meta (:ctx w) (:view w) raw-method)]
    (when (= "list" (kd w method))
    (walk-signature-types! w
      (rb/signature-parts (:ctx w) (:view w)
        (vec (rest (kids w method)))
        false
        false)
      scope
      wf))))

(defn- walk-protocol-method-types!
  [(w Walk) (raw-method Any) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any)] Any
  (let [parts (rm/protocol-method-parts
                (:ctx w) (:view w) raw-method)]
    (when (some? parts)
      (walk-signature-types! w
        {:params (get parts :params)
         :return-type (get parts :return-type)
         :raises-type nil}
        scope
        wf))))

(defn- walk-type-def! [(w Walk) (ks (Vec Any)) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any)] Any
  (let [head (str (sv w (nth ks 0 nil))) name-index (rc/type-name-index head (sv w (nth ks 1 nil))) members (vec (drop (inc name-index) ks))]
    (cond
      (= "defrecord" head)
      (let [fields (nth ks 2 nil)]
        (when (and (some? fields) (brk? w fields))
          (do
            (walk-binding-types! w
              (rb/param-type-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) fields))
            (walk-all! w
              (rb/param-constraint-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) fields)
              scope
              wf))))
      (= "deftype" head)
      (let [fields (nth ks 2 nil)]
        (do
          (when (and (some? fields) (brk? w fields))
            (do
              (walk-binding-types! w
                (rb/param-type-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) fields))
              (walk-all! w
                (rb/param-constraint-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) fields)
                scope
                wf)))
          (doseq [raw-member (vec (drop 3 ks))]
            (let [member (rr/unwrap-meta (:ctx w) (:view w) raw-member)]
              (cond
                (= "list" (kd w member))
                (walk-method-types! w member scope wf)
                (some? (sv w member))
                (walk-type! w member)
                :else
                nil)))))
      (contains? #{"defprotocol" "definterface"} head)
      (doseq [method members]
        (walk-protocol-method-types! w method scope wf))
      (= "defunion" head)
      (doseq [raw-member members]
        (let [member (rr/unwrap-meta (:ctx w) (:view w) raw-member)
              parts (rm/union-member-parts (:ctx w) (:view w) raw-member)]
        (cond
          (some? (get parts :fields))
          (let [fields (get parts :fields)]
            (do
              (walk-binding-types! w
                (rb/param-type-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) fields))
              (walk-all! w
                (rb/param-constraint-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) fields)
                scope
                wf)))
          (some? (get parts :name))
          (let [binding (tr w (sv w (get parts :name)))]
            (when (and (some? binding) (not= binding member))
              (do
                (bind! w member binding)
                (swap! (:ntype w) (fn [(n Int)] Int (inc n))))))
          :else
          nil)))
      :else
      nil)))

(defn- walk-executable!
  [(w Walk) (head String) (forms (Vec Any)) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any)] Any
  (doseq [signature
          (rb/executable-signatures
            (:ctx w) (:view w) head forms)]
    (walk-fn-signature! w
      signature scope wf (= "defmacro" head))))

(defn- walk-value-def! [(w Walk) (ks (Vec Any)) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any)] Any
  (let [tail (vec (drop 2 ks)) first-node (nth tail 0 nil) typed? (and (>= (count tail) 2) (not= "string" (kd w first-node))) value-node (last tail)]
    (do
      (when typed? (walk-type! w first-node))
      (when (some? value-node) (wf w value-node scope)))))

(defn- walk-extension! [(w Walk) (ks (Vec Any)) (scope (Vec Any)) (wf Any)] Any
  (let [head (str (sv w (nth ks 0 nil))) tail (vec (rest ks))]
    (if (= "extend" head)
      (do
        (when (some? (nth tail 0 nil)) (wf w (nth tail 0) scope))
        (when (some? (nth tail 1 nil)) (walk-type! w (nth tail 1)))
        (walk-all! w (vec (drop 2 tail)) scope wf))
      (doseq [raw-item tail]
        (let [item (rr/unwrap-meta (:ctx w) (:view w) raw-item)]
          (cond
            (some? (sv w item))
            (walk-type! w item)
            (= "list" (kd w item))
            (let [method (kids w item)]
              (do
                (when (some? (nth method 0 nil)) (wf w (nth method 0) scope))
                (walk-fn-arity! w (vec (rest method)) scope wf false)))
            :else
            nil))))))

(defn walk! [(w Walk) (node Any) (scope (Vec Any))] Any
  (let [k (kd w node)]
    (cond
      (= "symbol" k)
      (let [nm (sv w node) qualifier (sq w node) local (if (nil? qualifier) (scope-lookup scope nm) nil) bt (rr/bound-target (:ctx w) (:view w) (:BOUND w) node)]
        (cond
          (some? bt)
          (bound-render! w node nm bt)
          (some? local)
          (bind! w node local)
          (some? (bind-xmod! w node (xr w node nm)))
          nil
          (and (some? qualifier) (try-ctor! w node nm))
          nil
          (some? qualifier)
          (swap! (:nunres w) (fn [(n Int)] Int (inc n)))
          (try-type! w node nm)
          nil
          (try-ctor! w node nm)
          nil
          (try-accessor! w node nm)
          nil
          :else
          (swap! (:nunres w) (fn [(n Int)] Int (inc n)))))
      (= "list" k)
      (let [ks (kids w node) h (hd w node) hs (str h)]
        (cond
          (= "quote" hs)
          nil
          (= "quasiquote" hs)
          (walk-quasi! w node scope false walk! walk-quasi-seq!)
          (contains? rc/TYPE-DEFS hs)
          (walk-type-def! w ks scope walk!)
          (contains? rc/DEF-FORMS hs)
          (walk-value-def! w ks scope walk!)
          (contains? rc/PARAM-FORMS hs)
          (walk-executable! w
            hs
            (if (contains? #{"defn" "defn-" "defmacro"} hs)
              (vec (drop 2 ks))
              (vec (rest ks)))
            scope
            walk!)
          (contains? rc/LET-FORMS hs)
          (let [bracket (nth ks 1 nil) ok (and (some? bracket) (brk? w bracket)) _ (when ok (walk-binding-types! w (rb/let-type-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) bracket))) pairs (if ok (rb/let-bind-pairs (:ctx w) (:view w) bracket) []) final (reduce (fn
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    [(sc
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      (Vec
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       Any))
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (p
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      Any)]
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    (Vec Any)
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    (let [bsyms (nth p 0) vnode (nth p 1) orvals (nth p 2) constraint (nth p 3 nil)] (do (walk-all! w orvals sc walk!) (when (some? constraint) (walk! w constraint sc)) (when (some? vnode) (walk! w vnode sc)) (push (rb/frame-of (:ctx w) (:view w) bsyms) sc)))) scope pairs)]
            (walk-all! w (vec (drop 2 ks)) final walk!))
          (contains? rc/FOR-FORMS hs)
          (let [bracket (nth ks 1 nil) ok (and (some? bracket) (brk? w bracket)) _ (when ok (walk-binding-types! w (rb/for-type-nodes (:ctx w) (:view w) bracket))) entries (if ok (rb/for-bind-pairs (:ctx w) (:view w) bracket) []) final (reduce (fn
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      [(sc
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        (Vec
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         Any))
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       (e
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        Any)]
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      (Vec Any)
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      (if (= :expr (nth e 0)) (do (walk! w (nth e 1) sc) sc) (let [bsyms (nth e 1) vnode (nth e 2) orvals (nth e 3) constraint (nth e 4 nil)] (do (walk-all! w orvals sc walk!) (when (some? constraint) (walk! w constraint sc)) (when (some? vnode) (walk! w vnode sc)) (push (rb/frame-of (:ctx w) (:view w) bsyms) sc))))) scope entries)]
            (walk-all! w (vec (drop 2 ks)) final walk!))
          (contains? rc/MATCH-FORMS hs)
          (do
            (walk! w (nth ks 1 nil) scope)
            (doseq [clause (vec (filter (fn [(cl Any)] Bool (brk? w cl)) (vec (drop 2 ks))))]
              (let [cc (vec (rest (kids w clause))) pat (nth cc 0 nil) body (vec (rest cc))]
                (do
                  (walk-pat-heads! w pat scope walk!)
                  (walk-all! w
                    body
                    (push (rb/frame-of (:ctx w) (:view w) (rb/match-pat-binds (:ctx w) (:view w) pat))
                      scope)
                    walk!)))))
          (= "letfn" hs)
          (let [bracket (nth ks 1 nil) fnlists (if (and (some? bracket) (brk? w bracket)) (vec (filter (fn
                                                                                                         [(f
                                                                                                           Any)]
                                                                                                         Bool
                                                                                                         (= "list" (kd w f))) (vec (rest (kids w bracket))))) []) frame (rb/frame-of (:ctx w) (:view w) (vec (keep (fn
                                                                                                                                                                                                                     [(f
                                                                                                                                                                                                                       Any)]
                                                                                                                                                                                                                     Any
                                                                                                                                                                                                                     (nth (kids w f) 0 nil)) fnlists))) bodyscope (push frame scope)]
            (do
              (doseq [fl fnlists]
                (walk-fn-arity! w (vec (rest (kids w fl))) bodyscope walk! false))
              (walk-all! w (vec (drop 2 ks)) bodyscope walk!)))
          (contains? rc/EXTEND-FORMS hs)
          (walk-extension! w ks scope walk!)
          (= "as->" hs)
          (let [init (nth ks 1 nil) name (nth ks 2 nil) frame (rb/frame-of (:ctx w) (:view w) (if (some? (sv w name)) [name] []))]
            (do
              (when (some? init) (walk! w init scope))
              (walk-all! w (vec (drop 3 ks)) (push frame scope) walk!)))
          :else
          (walk-all! w ks scope walk!)))
      :else
      nil)))

(defn cbind! [(w Walk) (L Any) (target Any)] Any
  (do
    (ri/assert! (:ctx w) (nn L) (:REFERS w) (nn target))
    (swap! (:ncomment w) (fn [(n Int)] Int (inc n)))))

(defn- def-binding [(cp Corpus) (src Any) (nm Any)] Any
  (let [v (get (get (:modframe cp) src) nm)]
    (if (some? v) v (get (get (:typeframe cp) src) nm))))

(defn resolve-comment! [(w Walk) (cp Corpus) (e Any) (src Any)] Any
  (doseq [seg (vec (filter (fn [(s Any)] Bool (= "symbol" (kd w s))) (rr/ordered-segs (:ctx w) e)))]
    (let [nm (sv w seg) qualifier (sq w seg) local (if (nil? qualifier) (def-binding cp src nm) nil) b (if (some? local) local (get (xr w seg nm) :target))]
      (when (some? b) (cbind! w seg b)))))

(defn walk-comments! [(w Walk) (cp Corpus) (src Any)] Any
  (doseq [e (vec (filter (fn [(x Any)] Bool (= "comment" (kd w x))) (vec (get (:ents cp) src []))))]
    (resolve-comment! w cp e src)))

(defn- for-src [(w Walk) (cp Corpus) (src Any) (xres-for Any)] Walk
  (->Walk (:ctx w)
    (:view w)
    (:REFERS w)
    (:BOUND w)
    (:FIXED w)
    (:QUAL w)
    (:CTOR w)
    (:ACC w)
    (:nres w)
    (:nunres w)
    (:nxmod w)
    (:ntype w)
    (:ncomment w)
    (xres-for src)
    (fn [(nm Any)] Any (get (get (:typeframe cp) src) nm))
    (fn [(nm Any)] Any (get (get (:accessors cp) src) nm))))

(defn run-resolution-over!
  [(w Walk)
   (cp Corpus)
   (walk-srcs (Vec Any))
   (xres-for Any)
   (n-forms (Atom Int))
   (walked Any)]
  Any
  (doseq [src walk-srcs]
    (let [w2 (for-src w cp src xres-for) ents (vec (get (:ents cp) src [])) forms (rm/forms-of (:ctx w) (:view w) ents)]
      (do
        (swap! walked conj src)
        (swap! n-forms + (count forms))
        (walk-all! w2 forms [(get (:modframe cp) src)] walk!)
        (walk-comments! w2 cp src)))))

(defn run-resolution!
  [(w Walk) (cp Corpus) (xres-for Any) (n-forms (Atom Int)) (walked Any)] Any
  (run-resolution-over! w cp (:srcs cp) xres-for n-forms walked))

(defn corpus-tables
  [(ctx (U ri/Graph Nil))
   (view Any)
   (srcs (Vec Any))
   (ents-of Any)]
  (Map Keyword Any)
  (let [per (fn [(f Any)] Any (reduce (fn
                                        [(m (Map Any Any))
                                         (s Any)]
                                        (Map Any Any)
                                        (assoc m s (f (vec (get ents-of s []))))) {} srcs)) named (vec (filter (fn
                                                                                                                 [(s
                                                                                                                   Any)]
                                                                                                                 Bool
                                                                                                                 (some? (rm/module-name ctx view (vec (get ents-of s []))))) srcs)) by-mod (fn
                                                                                                                                                                                             [(f
                                                                                                                                                                                               Any)]
                                                                                                                                                                                             Any
                                                                                                                                                                                             (reduce (fn
                                                                                                                                                                                                       [(m
                                                                                                                                                                                                         (Map
                                                                                                                                                                                                          Any
                                                                                                                                                                                                          Any))
                                                                                                                                                                                                        (s
                                                                                                                                                                                                         Any)]
                                                                                                                                                                                                       (Map Any Any)
                                                                                                                                                                                                       (let [ents (vec (get ents-of s []))] (assoc m (rm/module-name ctx view ents) (f ents)))) {} named))]
    {:modframe
     (per (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (rm/module-defs ctx view ents)))
     :typeframe
     (per (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (rm/module-types ctx view ents)))
     :accessors
     (per (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (rm/module-accessors ctx view ents)))
     :exports
     (by-mod (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (let [e (rm/module-exports ctx view ents)] (if (empty? e) (rm/module-defs ctx view ents) e))))
     :type-exports
     (by-mod (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (rm/module-types ctx view ents)))
     :accessor-exports
     (by-mod (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (rm/module-accessors ctx view ents)))}))

(defn warm-groups [(ctx ri/Graph) (cache Any) (name->module Any)] Any
  (if (some? cache)
    cache
    (reduce (fn [(groups Any) (occ Any)] Any (let [node-name (ri/value-at ctx occ) module (name->module node-name)] (if (some? module) (update groups module (fnil conj []) (ri/subject-at ctx occ)) groups)))
      {}
      (ri/by-predicate ctx "name"))))

(defn scoped-corpus-tables
  [(ctx ri/Graph) (view Any) (groups Any) (scope Any)] (Map Keyword Any)
  (let [srcs (vec (keys groups)) frame-srcs (if (some? scope) (vec (filter scope srcs)) srcs) per-frame (fn
                                                                                                          [(f
                                                                                                            Any)]
                                                                                                          Any
                                                                                                          (reduce (fn
                                                                                                                    [(table
                                                                                                                      Any)
                                                                                                                     (src
                                                                                                                      Any)]
                                                                                                                    Any
                                                                                                                    (assoc table src (f (vec (get groups src []))))) {} frame-srcs)) named (vec (filter (fn
                                                                                                                                                                                                          [(src
                                                                                                                                                                                                            Any)]
                                                                                                                                                                                                          Bool
                                                                                                                                                                                                          (some? (rm/module-name ctx view (vec (get groups src []))))) srcs)) by-module (fn
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          [(f
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            Any)]
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          Any
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          (if (some? scope) {} (reduce (fn
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         [(table
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Any)
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          (src
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Any)]
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         Any
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         (let [ents (vec (get groups src []))] (assoc table (rm/module-name ctx view ents) (f ents)))) {} named)))]
    {:srcs
     srcs
     :modframe
     (per-frame (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (rm/module-defs ctx view ents)))
     :typeframe
     (per-frame (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (rm/module-types ctx view ents)))
     :accessors
     (per-frame (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (rm/module-accessors ctx view ents)))
     :exports
     (by-module (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (let [exports (rm/module-exports ctx view ents)] (if (empty? exports) (rm/module-defs ctx view ents) exports))))
     :type-exports
     (by-module (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (rm/module-types ctx view ents)))
     :accessor-exports
     (by-module (fn [(ents (Vec Any))] Any (rm/module-accessors ctx view ents)))}))
